        <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.88em;">Chinese RP Language Game. Dictionary data: <a href="https://www.mdbg.net/chinese/dictionary?page=cc-cedict" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC-CEDICT</a> (CC BY-SA 4.0).</p>
